  "id": "adult-education",
  "term": "adult education",
  "definition": "Adult education is planned learning for adults that may address skill gaps, but is not mainly limited to correcting deficiencies. It more broadly focuses on the goals adults set for themselves and on how they want to use and develop their existing resources, including support for adults at risk of exclusion.",
